# packaging/linux/Dockerfile.smoke — reproduces the Linux CI job locally (build + headless smoke + AppImage)
FROM ubuntu:22.04
ENV DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive
RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y software-properties-common curl git xvfb libfuse2 file \
    libxcb-cursor0 libxkbcommon-x11-0 libxcb-icccm4 libxcb-image0 libxcb-keysyms1 libxcb-render-util0 \
    libxcb-shape0 libxcb-xinerama0 libnss3 libasound2 libgl1 libegl1 libxdamage1 libxcomposite1 libxrandr2 \
    libxtst6 libdbus-1-3 wl-clipboard xclip && \
    add-apt-repository -y ppa:deadsnakes/ppa && apt-get update && \
    apt-get install -y python3.11 python3.11-venv python3.11-dev && \
    curl -fsSL https://deb.nodesource.com/setup_20.x | bash - && apt-get install -y nodejs && \
    rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
WORKDIR /src
COPY backend/requirements.lock backend/
RUN python3.11 -m venv /venv && \
    /venv/bin/pip install --require-hashes -r backend/requirements.lock
COPY frontend/package.json frontend/package-lock.json frontend/
RUN cd frontend && npm ci
# PyInstaller needs objdump on Linux (GitHub runners ship binutils; this image does not)
RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y binutils && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
COPY . .
RUN cd frontend && npm run build
RUN /venv/bin/python scripts/build_desktop.py --skip-frontend
ENV QTWEBENGINE_CHROMIUM_FLAGS="--no-sandbox --disable-gpu"
RUN xvfb-run -a /venv/bin/python scripts/smoke_desktop.py && bash scripts/package_linux.sh && ls -la dist
